From: denglei <denglei@eswincomputing.com>
Date: Tue, 21 Oct 2025 16:34:45 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 524/534] fix:merge npu code from dev to pm branch.

Changelogs:
	merge npu code from dev to pm branch.

Signed-off-by: denglei <denglei@eswincomputing.com>
---
 arch/riscv/boot/dts/eswin/eic7702-d560a.dts   |  6 ++
 .../dts/eswin/eswin-win2030-die0-soc.dtsi     |  1 -
